OL,3,GNEWSADrivers rethink spending as fuel
OL,4,Aprices climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoaring fuel prices are forcing
OL,7,Fmotorists to cut back on everyday
OL,8,Fspending and adding tens of thousands
OL,9,Fof pounds a week to business costs,
OL,10,Fwith petrol at its highest level since
OL,11,FNovember 2022.
OL,13,FDrivers say they are changing their
OL,14,Fspending habits to cope with rising
OL,15,Fcosts at the pump, while businesses
OL,16,Fwarn higher fuel bills are placing
OL,17,Fincreasing pressure on their finances.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
