OL,3,GNEWSADrivers rethink spending as fuel
OL,4,Aprices climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol prices rose to an average of
OL,7,F161.3p per litre between July and
OL,8,FAugust, according to the Office for
OL,9,FNational Statistics (ONS), the highest
OL,10,Flevel recorded since November 2022,
OL,11,Fwhen Russia's invasion of Ukraine
OL,12,Fpushed up global energy costs.
OL,14,FDiesel is also expected to top #2 per
OL,15,Flitre in the coming days.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
